      <div type="layout" source="#source-214096-214187" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214131-214152"><rb>仮令</rb><rt>たとえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214152-214187">ば木像製活字版等の如し</seg></p>
