      <div type="layout" source="#source-214308-214453" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p><seg source="#source-214343-214367">交易の品に御定め</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214367-214403"><rb>売捌所</rb><rt>うりさばきじょ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214403-214409">、御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-214409-214427"><rb>許</rb><rt>ゆる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-214427-214453">し御座ありたく候</seg></p>
