        <div type="layout" source="#source-302913-303010" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
          <p><seg source="#source-302948-302966">日本国君殿下</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-302966-303010" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(3)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=3"><seg source="#source-302996-303010">和蘭国王</seg></seg></p>
