        <p><seg source="#source-467908-467926">安政二年正月</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-467926-467953"><rb>朔旦</rb><rt>さくたん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-467953-467958">賀</seg></p>
